<title>JAPAN: Shinko Kogyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Kogyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.91		vs	   11.34</p>
<p> Operating	  467    million	  vs	  322    million</p>
<p> Current	    734    million	  vs	  500    million</p>
<p> Net		  402    million	  vs	  324    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.72 yen	  vs	   11.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  27 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinko Kogyo Co Ltd is the largest manufacturer of office airconditioning equipment.</p>
